    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's examine the dialogue step by step. Notice the sharp, imperative military commands and urgent responses used during a police raid.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всем лежать! Работает специальный отряд!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone down! Special forces at work!' Impersonal dative infinitive command followed by a third person present verb.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всем лежать на полу, я сказал!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone down on the floor, I said!' Firm command with an infinitive, prepositional phrase on the floor, and a past tense verb.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Бросить оружие! Руки за голову!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Drop weapons! Hands behind head!' Infinitive imperative command followed by an accusative prepositional direction phrase.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "pasha",
      "t": "Пожалуйста, не стреляйте, мы сдаёмся!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please do not shoot, we surrender!' Polite particle with a negative plural imperative verb and a reflexive present verb.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Никакой ошибки нет, вы арестованы!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no mistake, you are under arrest!' Negative construction with genitive case followed by a short passive past participle.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "pasha",
      "t": "Я буду говорить только с адвокатом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
